    "sentence_translations": [
      "Slap in the Face",
      "",
      "Lili: We better bring an umbrella when we go out. It might rain today.",
      "",
      "Little He: There’s no need. It definitely won’t rain today.",
      "",
      "(10 minutes later, it started raining)",
      "",
      "Lili: Look, been slapped in the face? You’ll definitely catch a cold when you go back.",
      "",
      "Little He: I won’t. I’m made of iron, and won’t catch a cold.",
      "",
      "(In the evening)",
      "",
      "Little He: Atchoo, atchoo…",
      "",
      "Lili: Look, been slapped in the face? I said you would catch a cold! Maybe you’ll run a fever as well.",
      "",
      "Little He: I won’t. I’m made of iron, and won’t run a fever.",
      "",
      "(The next day)",
      "",
      "Little He: Heavens! I have a fever!",
      "",
      "Lili: Look, been slapped in the face? Maybe you’ll even run a high fever.",
      "",
      "Little He: …",
      "",
      "Lili: Why don’t you say anything this time?",
      "",
      "Little He: Sigh, because I don’t want to be slapped in the face again.",
      ""
